    "body": "Unlucky for us, the new symbol is part of the NerdFonts codepoint leakage reported in 2019. I don't have a feel for how close they are to fixing that issue, and I don't think it should be a blocker, but we should make a mental note that this is a potential problem for anyone who uses a language that uses CJK codepoints.",
